#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:4 9b8916bc2aa945ea9b57605dff48d7a8
msgid "Team accounts"
msgstr "团队账户"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:6 e66929a6640c4a6aae3ebbd270b338b9
msgid ""
"A Team lets you work together with your coworkers: invite them, share "
"projects and spend credits from one shared balance."
msgstr "团队可让您与同事协作：邀请他们、共享项目，并从同一个共享余额中支出积分。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:8 41a2810a41794ae18f48504ef481d160
msgid "Open **Team** in the main menu on the left (sidebar)."
msgstr "在左侧主菜单（侧边栏）中打开 **团队**。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:11 a6c9717ceab14007be7afd63dd55d7fe
msgid ""
"We highly encourage you to use a Team if you work with other coworkers "
"and manage multiple projects. Feel free to contact our support, so we can"
" assist you in setting up a Team workflow."
msgstr "如果您与其他同事合作并管理多个项目，我们强烈建议您使用团队。请随时联系我们的支持人员，以便我们帮助您设置团队工作流程。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:15 d80d02821aa74617acec8dc94d309ddb
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:17 b8280b92074346afab245f1025c533b2
msgid "There are two roles in a Team:"
msgstr "团队中有两种角色："

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:19 e408d17831a1411c8ebbaab317d868ac
msgid ""
"**Admin** – invites users and manages the Team balance. The Admin's "
"balance is the Team's balance."
msgstr "**管理员** – 邀请用户并管理团队余额。管理员的余额即为团队的余额。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:20 4dfefead44a84b7c8a76f74990a482cf
msgid "**User** – joins the Team by invitation and spends the Team's credits."
msgstr "**用户** – 通过邀请加入团队，并支出团队的积分。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:24 5b7333d61f48434483f9ebf6e1918e70
#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Invite team members"
msgstr "邀请团队成员"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:26 c16503f88cd944e7a57d77ab66132d8a
msgid "Enter the user's email in **Invite team members**."
msgstr "在 **邀请团队成员** 中输入用户的电子邮件。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:27 ed01ccd1efdb40a7b0a627a1410376fe
msgid "Click **Send invite**. The user receives the invitation by email."
msgstr "单击 **发送邀请**。用户将通过电子邮件收到邀请。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:28 ee9f1120af9c4ba0bd1ebc94a7b47796
msgid ""
"Until the user accepts it, they are shown in the members list as "
"**Pending invitation**."
msgstr "在用户接受邀请之前，其在成员列表中显示为 **待接受邀请**。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:39 a03b96492da348b39fb5dd1d9a26a167
msgid ""
"If the user is not registered at Mapflow yet, they can join the Team "
"after signing up."
msgstr "如果用户尚未在 Mapflow 注册，可以在注册后加入团队。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:43 936165d5fa104d28a63f2f10235ca6ec
msgid "Join a Team"
msgstr "加入团队"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:45 a15ae53113bb4fcabfe6e024724d7b59
msgid "The invited user sees the invitation at the top of the **Team** page."
msgstr "受邀用户会在 **团队** 页面顶部看到邀请。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:46 2fae8c0d431a496f8ea9865e2e3b45a7
msgid ""
"Click **Accept** to join the Team, or **Decline** to reject the "
"invitation."
msgstr "单击 **接受** 加入团队，或单击 **拒绝** 拒绝邀请。"

#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Accept the invitation to the Team"
msgstr "接受团队邀请"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:56 b27eafa0991d4b278b522754b802b385
msgid "After joining the Team:"
msgstr "加入团队后："

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:58 1bb79e52862f4615a6c1f8ac8ff2697f
msgid "You spend the Team's credits."
msgstr "您将支出团队的积分。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:59 842f0993a4744608bd4bc57d70022d55
msgid "Your personal balance stays untouched."
msgstr "您的个人余额保持不变。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:60 49cb252f5b754140a333e64351c2bf52
msgid "You can't create your own Team as long as you stay in this one."
msgstr "只要您留在此团队中，就无法创建自己的团队。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:64 fc7d9f63a0ae4e84bcb142be58b278d3
msgid "Manage Team balance"
msgstr "管理团队余额"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:66 a4dfc47f538447209e487f829e73b513
msgid "The Admin manages the balance of the whole Team:"
msgstr "管理员负责管理整个团队的余额："

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:68 edaf073e7ec2483ba785460ab881c913
msgid "**Add credits** (**+**) – move credits from the Admin's balance to a user."
msgstr "**添加积分**（**+**）– 将积分从管理员的余额转给用户。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:69 c2947424cfa94b23b9d24ee20fbd4de3
msgid ""
"**Withdraw credits** (**-**) – take credits back from a user to the "
"Admin's balance."
msgstr "**收回积分**\\ （**-**）– 将积分从用户处收回到管理员的余额。"

#: 64805a262c7c4f44a7f069915e4c1aa4
msgid "Add or withdraw member's credits"
msgstr "添加或收回成员的积分"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:79 02182d28910843238b6e0516b7563819
msgid "At the top of the page you can see:"
msgstr "在页面顶部，您可以看到："

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:81 4abb6f1a26a74f24890355a8726cc07e
msgid ""
"**Credits left** – credits remaining in the Team. Click **+** to top up "
"the Team balance."
msgstr "**剩余积分** – 团队中剩余的积分。单击 **+** 为团队余额充值。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:82 55d8c99769074580a75b9341c7036d48
msgid "**Credits used** – credits spent by the Team."
msgstr "**已用积分** – 团队已支出的积分。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:83 a5990687d15541ba89f21d0efa146c30
msgid "**Members** – number of Team members."
msgstr "**成员** – 团队成员数量。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:85 ecefeeb1666148b88f16228dbc35fb4a
msgid ""
"The members list shows each member's role, credits **Used** and credits "
"**Left**."
msgstr "成员列表显示每位成员的角色、**已用** 积分和 **剩余** 积分。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:87 5a36fb1e8a064de48032f48cdd5a7d4a
msgid "Both your Team balance and personal balance are displayed in the header."
msgstr "您的团队余额和个人余额都会显示在页眉中。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:90 074052e21cdb4f9ba58f5141fd09742c
msgid ""
"If your Team account is switched to area-based billing, the only "
"difference is that the balance is managed in sq. km."
msgstr "如果您的团队帐户切换为按面积计费，唯一的区别是余额以平方公里为单位进行管理。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:94 b27eafa0991d4b278b522754b802b385
msgid "Project sharing in the Team"
msgstr "团队中的项目共享"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:96 f1f8dc515cd14695834a9b6f310501c3
msgid ""
"You can share your project with anyone in the Team and assign his role as"
" needed. Go to the `Projects <https://app.mapflow.ai/en/projects>`_. "
"Click on a dot menu icon in a project card -- Share."
msgstr ""
"您可以与团队中的任何人共享您的项目，并根据需要分配他的角色。转到\\ `项目 "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/en/projects>`_。单击项目卡中的点菜单图标 - 共享。"

#: 552a99022642454596b16478ae66f4a6 e6edc7bbd9c140bd859189e54e6b5d59
msgid "Share project"
msgstr "分享项目"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:106 dfde578fcf4e4e5bad617a0c11da6689
msgid ""
"Select your coworkers or toggle \"Anyone in the team\" if you want to "
"share with all of them."
msgstr "如果您想与所有人共享，请选择您的同事或切换“团队中的任何人”。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:114 d50631b8f0214fdbad1523587850793d
msgid ""
"There are four types of the project user's role that can be assigned to "
"your coworkers:"
msgstr "可以分配给您的同事的项目用户角色有四种类型："

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:116 7652b357a4ea46e2ba9f489ff05ecf41
msgid "**readonly** - can view the project history and the results"
msgstr "**只读** - 可以查看项目历史记录和结果"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:117 6c2f27acf5994eabab7f252b2c5383b4
msgid "**contributor** – can run the workflows in the project"
msgstr "**贡献者** – 可以运行项目中的工作流程"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:118 db4550eb101d442181a134cfb09fdb2d
msgid ""
"**maintainer** – can run and edit the workflows, and share projects with "
"users (up to maintainer role)"
msgstr "**维护者** – 可以运行和编辑工作流程，并与用户共享项目（最高可达维护者角色）"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:119 8bc4c707799943ef9154949a6d2180d6
msgid "**owner** – full rights to edit all roles in the project"
msgstr "**所有者** – 编辑项目中所有角色的完全权限"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:121 e3eca4be191f4cc9ad8ce9f97fbda77a
msgid ""
"Your collaborators will see the new shared projects in their dashboard "
"and use them according to the role assigned."
msgstr "您的协作者将在他们的仪表板中看到新的共享项目，并根据分配的角色使用它们。"

#: ../userguides/team_accounts.rst:124 cc230419b45c4efd856f7c53202db87f
msgid ""
"You can also share your project with any users outside your team for the "
"view-only access. Go to the Project -- Share and enter the existing "
"Mapflow user's email. If the new user is not registered at Mapflow.ai, "
"invite him to register first."
msgstr ""
"您还可以与团队外部的任何用户共享您的项目，以进行仅查看访问。转到项目 - 共享并输入现有 Mapflow 用户的电子邮件。如果新用户未在 "
"Mapflow.ai 注册，请先邀请他注册。"

